      "readOnlyHint": true,
    },
    "description": "Resolve a reference in one call: id, pasted public or Admin link, @handle, sourceId, or free text. {query:"/catalog/abc"}, {query:"https://.../?articleId=article-..."}, {query:"兰亭序",type:"catalog"}. resolution says exact, candidates or none. Use resolution.ref for a mutation, never the first candidate. A branch that did not answer is named in meta.sources, never read as zero. Neither none nor a short candidate list proves absence: a draft Catalog is matched on its title only, as typed and by one simplified-traditional conversion, so another form of a character and any draft alias are missed. Retry in the other form before saying it does not exist.",
